// Flattened entrana_firebird.rs2's [ai_queue3,fire_bird] table.
// npc_param(death_drop) is unset (null) on the fire_bird .npc config. The
// hot_feather drop is gated on %heroquest < ^hero_complete - a per-player
// quest-state conditional, out of scope per the "no quest-state" resolved
// decision (same treatment as Ring of Wealth/Legends' Quest: condition
